# The repository must stay PUBLIC for the org profile README to render, so
# visibility is not an access control here — this file and branch protection
# are.
#
# Requires @cogniumhq/coreteam to keep write access and "Require review from
# Code Owners" to stay enabled. Verify with:
#   gh api repos/cogniumhq/.github/codeowners/errors --jq '.errors|length'
#
# See cogniumhq/cognium-dev#442.

* @cogniumhq/coreteam

# CI that other repositories adopt and execute. The scanning template requests
# `security-events: write`; a change to what it runs, or to the action version
# it pins, propagates to every repo that adds it.
/workflow-templates/ @cogniumhq/coreteam

# The organization's public landing page.
/profile/ @cogniumhq/coreteam
